# Arma 3 mod manifest. Copy to `mods.conf` and edit. One mod per line.
# Format: name|source|spec|tag
#   name   = mod folder slug (becomes mods/@<name>, no spaces, lowercase)
#   source = github | workshop | local
#   spec   = github → "owner/repo"
#            workshop → numeric workshop ID
#            local → subdirectory name under /mod-src (i.e. ./files/<name>)
#   tag    = github → release tag (e.g. "v11.9.9", "3.11.1") or "latest"
#            workshop / local → ignored (use "-")
#
# Install order matters for some mods — dependencies first (CBA before ACE).
# The same order is used for the `-mod=` launch flag.

# Primary mission mod — pick ONE Antistasi.
antistasi_ultimate|github|Antistasi-Ultimate-Community/A3-Antistasi-Ultimate|latest
# antistasi_community|github|official-antistasi-community/A3-Antistasi|3.11.1

# Support mods (uncomment what you want).
# cba_a3|workshop|450814997|-
# ace3|workshop|463939057|-
# rhs_afrf|workshop|843425103|-
# rhs_usaf|workshop|843577117|-
